common_passwords.txt.gz is derived from two MIT-licensed works:
Passwords/Common-Credentials/Pwdb_top-1000000.txt of SecLists
(https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists), which comes from Pwdb-Public
(https://github.com/ignis-sec/Pwdb-Public). Kept: entries of 10 to 200 characters,
lower-cased, first occurrence only, in the original order (fetched 2026-11-15).

